{"k":{"t01-apar-0":"<span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"12.6pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">LIBRET EXPLICATIV</span> <span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"8.4pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">DA</span> <span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"15.6pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">las tabellas auxiliaras Delmas</span> <span class=\"orn\">❦</span> <span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"13.2pt\" data-rolo=\"serio\">EMPRIMA SERIA</span> <span class=\"fil\"></span>","t01-apar-1":"<span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"15.0pt\" data-rolo=\"nom\">TABELLA nr. 1</span> <span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"11.4pt\" data-rolo=\"tit\">La scola. — L’institut. — La sala da scola.</span> <span class=\"fil\"></span>","t01-tit-1":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Descripziun generala.</span>","t01-01-1":"1. — Questa tabella represchenta ina <b>sala da scola</b> en in <b>institut</b>. En questa sala da scola i ha otg <b>maisas</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.339325,0.560105,0.009987,0.010154\" data-n=\"18\" title=\"maisas\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(18)</sup></button> ed otg <b>bancs</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.298491,0.886341,0.009543,0.012447\" data-n=\"32\" title=\"bancs\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(32)</sup></button>. Sin mintga banc sesan trais scolars. Il <b>magister</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.104527,0.503767,0.004882,0.010481\" data-n=\"7\" title=\"magister\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(7)</sup></button> sesa sin ina <b>sutga</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.072792,0.542745,0.00466,0.012119\" data-n=\"8\" title=\"sutga\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(8)</sup></button> a sia <b>catedra</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.134043,0.602358,0.00466,0.011137\" data-n=\"6\" title=\"catedra\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(6)</sup></button>.","t01-02-1":"2. — A sanestra da la catedra sa chatta in <b>armari</b> cun portas da vaider <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.188859,0.618736,0.008877,0.010481\" data-n=\"15\" title=\"fisica\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(15)</sup></button>. A dretga è la <b>tavla naira</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.016644,0.59679,0.003329,0.010481\" data-n=\"1\" title=\"tavla naira\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(1)</sup></button> cun il <b>sfruschader</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.034842,0.685228,0.005548,0.010154\" data-n=\"2\" title=\"sfruschader\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(2)</sup></button> e la <b>crida</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.055704,0.744186,0.004882,0.010481\" data-n=\"3\" title=\"crida\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(3)</sup></button>.","t01-02-2":"Sur la catedra pendan <b>tavlas da mir</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.042166,0.4887,0.00466,0.010481\" data-n=\"9\" title=\"tavlas da mir\" aria-expanded=\"false\">9</button>, <button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.097426,0.279725,0.007767,0.010481\" data-n=\"11\" title=\"tavlas da mir\" aria-expanded=\"false\">11</button>, <button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.170883,0.311824,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"12\" title=\"tavlas da mir\" aria-expanded=\"false\">12</button>)</sup> ed ina <b>charta geografica</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.117843,0.250901,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"10\" title=\"charta geografica\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(10)</sup></button>.","t01-03-1":"3. — Betg tut ils scolars sesan a lur <b>plaz</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.290945,0.528005,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"17\" title=\"plaz\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(17)</sup></button>. Gion <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.006658,0.712414,0.00577,0.010481\" data-n=\"4\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(4)</sup></button> stat sper la tavla; el tegna il sfruschader e stizza las <b>figuras geometricas</b>.","t01-03-2":"Peider è dasperas la catedra; el rimna ils <b>exercizis scrits</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.092543,0.64756,0.005104,0.010809\" data-n=\"5\" title=\"exercizis scrits\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(5)</sup></button> ed als porta al magister.","t01-04-1":"4. — <b>Quest</b> magister è il magister da <b>linguas vivas</b>. El instruescha als scolars da discurrer, leger e scriver linguas estras <b>(tudestg, englais, spagnol, talian, russ</b> u <b>franzos)</b>.","t01-05-1":"5. — La sala da scola è fitg vasta e fitg clera. En il fund i ha ina largia <b>fanestra</b>, dus <b>vasistas</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.336662,0.236489,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"78\" title=\"vasistas\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(78)</sup></button> ed ina <b>porta da vaider</b> per l’arieschar e l’illuminar.","t01-05-2":"Questa sala da scola n’è betg fraida. En il mez i ha, per la stgaudar, in fitg bun <b>fuorn</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.543054,0.73567,0.011984,0.010809\" data-n=\"46\" title=\"fuorn\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(46)</sup></button> cun ses <b>tub</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.506214,0.622666,0.010431,0.011464\" data-n=\"45\" title=\"tub\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(45)</sup></button>.","t01-05-3":"Vi da la paraid èn fixadas <b>hoccas da vestgadira</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.908566,0.720275,0.009543,0.011464\" data-n=\"58\" title=\"hoccas da vestgadira\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(58)</sup></button>; vi da quellas pendan las bricolas ed ils mantels dals scolars.","t01-tit-2":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">La curt da recreaziun.</span>","t01-06-1":"6. — L’<b>ura</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.781846,0.21225,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"63\" title=\"ura\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(63)</sup></button> mussa nov uras e tschintg minutas.","t01-06-2":"La <b>recreaziun</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.38016,0.384212,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"76\" title=\"recreaziun\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(76)</sup></button> è gist finida e la lecziun cumenza danovamain. La recreaziun ha lieu en la <b>curt</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.36285,0.442516,0.008655,0.010154\" data-n=\"75\" title=\"curt\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(75)</sup></button>. Nus vesain intgins scolars che giogan. In <b>sutmagister</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.419441,0.372093,0.011318,0.010481\" data-n=\"74\" title=\"sutmagister\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(74)</sup></button> als survegliescha.","t01-07-1":"7. — En la curt vesain nus dapli persunas: l’<b>inspectur</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.400355,0.432689,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"73\" title=\"inspectur\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(73)</sup></button>, il <b>directur</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.47692,0.431379,0.008655,0.010809\" data-n=\"71\" title=\"directur\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(71)</sup></button> ed il <b>censur</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.441411,0.428431,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"72\" title=\"censur\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(72)</sup></button>.","t01-07-2":"L’inspectur inspecziunescha las scolas, il directur dirigescha l’institut, il censur survegliescha ils studis.","t01-07-3":"La quarta persuna è il <b>portier</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.33644,0.429414,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"77\" title=\"portier\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(77)</sup></button>. El porta sut il bratsch in register per inscriver ils absents.","t01-08-1":"8. — En il fund da la curt sa chattan ils <b>apparats da gimnastica</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.467599,0.393384,0.009543,0.009826\" data-n=\"70\" title=\"apparats da gimnastica\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(70)</sup></button> e l’<b>ovratori</b> da <b>lavurs manualas</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.559698,0.471995,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"69\" title=\"lavurs manualas\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(69)</sup></button>.","t01-08-2":"A dretga da la tabella cumenzain nus a vesair las <b>salas</b> da <b>musica</b> e da <b>dissegn</b>.","t01-tit-3":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Descripziun detagliada.</span>","t01-tit-4":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Ils buns scolars.</span>","t01-09-1":"9. — Ils scolars da l’emprim banc a dretga da la catedra èn <b>Enric</b> <button class=\"apel\" data-noto=\"rm-t01-noto-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\">(*)</button>, <b>Stefan</b> e <b>Carli</b>.","t01-09-2":"Enric è fitg attentiv e lavurus; el asculta il magister. Sin sia maisa ha el in <b>quadern</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.230581,0.868981,0.010209,0.011464\" data-n=\"28\" title=\"quadern\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(28)</sup></button>, in <b>cudesch</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.199068,0.863085,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"29\" title=\"cudesch\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(29)</sup></button>, in <b>vocabulari</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.159565,0.891582,0.010874,0.011137\" data-n=\"30\" title=\"vocabulari\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(30)</sup></button> ed ina <b>chaschetta da penns</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.214603,0.905011,0.009543,0.011137\" data-n=\"31\" title=\"chaschetta da penns\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(31)</sup></button>. Ses cudesch ha bleras <b>paginas</b>; mintga chapitel cuntegna pliras <b>paragrafs</b> e mintga <b>lingia</b> blers <b>pleds</b>.","t01-09-4":"Ses vischin Stefan <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.291389,0.81035,0.012206,0.010154\" data-n=\"24\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(24)</sup></button> è fervent. El nota en ses quadern la lecziun per la proxima giada. El ha ina bella <b>scrittira</b>. Ses cudesch è serrà. Nus vesain mo la <b>cuvertura</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.201287,0.804455,0.010431,0.010809\" data-n=\"27\" title=\"cuvertura\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(27)</sup></button>. Sper el sa chatta ses <b>cumpass</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.21771,0.820832,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"26\" title=\"cumpass\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(26)</sup></button>.","t01-09-5":"Carli <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.270084,0.730102,0.009987,0.011137\" data-n=\"23\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(23)</sup></button> tegna ses cudesch en maun; el al avra per repeter sia lecziun. Sco mintga scolar ha el in <b>encausteri</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.241456,0.717982,0.011318,0.009826\" data-n=\"25\" title=\"encausteri\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(25)</sup></button> avant el. El è obedient.","t01-10-1":"10. — A la maisa dasperas èn <b>Luis, Antoni</b> e <b>Pauli</b>. Luis recitescha sia <b>lecziun</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.365291,0.645922,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"22\" title=\"lecziun\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(22)</sup></button> e responda a las <b>dumondas</b> dal magister. Antoni <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.329117,0.630855,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"21\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(21)</sup></button> è fitg distratg; mintgatant al chastiescha il magister schizunt. Pauli <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.334665,0.600721,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"20\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(20)</sup></button> è in bun <b>cumpogn</b>, amiaivel e servetsch. El è fitg attentiv.","t01-tit-5":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Ils mals scolars.</span>","t01-11-1":"11. — Suenter Enric sa chatta <b>Gieri</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.543276,0.87455,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"38\" title=\"Gieri\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(38)</sup></button>. El n’è betg in nausch mat, ma el è <b>tschintschader</b>, distratg e malquiet. Sia <b>superficialitad</b> e sia <b>malobedienza</b> chaschunan <b>disturbi</b> durant la lecziun, ed el merita savens in sever <b>avertiment</b>. Ses <b>quadern da sbozz</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.486906,0.885686,0.009987,0.010809\" data-n=\"35\" title=\"quadern da sbozz\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(35)</sup></button> è nausch, el l’emplenescha da <b>maglias d’encaust</b> cun sia <b>penna</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.513316,0.936456,0.011762,0.008516\" data-n=\"34\" title=\"penna\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(34)</sup></button>, e perquai duvra el adina sia <b>gumma da stizzar</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.478695,0.859155,0.010874,0.011137\" data-n=\"36\" title=\"gumma da stizzar\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(36)</sup></button>; sia <b>chartatscha</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.454949,0.912217,0.010431,0.012119\" data-n=\"33\" title=\"chartatscha\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(33)</sup></button> è squarschada, perquai ch’el è fitg negligent. Pertge porta el ses <b>portamina</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.496671,0.864723,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"37\" title=\"portamina\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(37)</sup></button> en la sala da scola da linguas vivas?","t01-11-2":"Ses vischin Edmund <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.53573,0.800852,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"39\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(39)</sup></button> n’al ha betg gugent. El è propi in pau pigher, ma el è taschaivel e sa tegna quiet. El na tschintscha betg; mo, empè d’ascultar, preferescha el da leger las <b>istorgias</b> da ses <b>cudesch da lectura</b>.","t01-11-3":"Il terz scolar da quest banc è <b>Luis</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.483577,0.767114,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"40\" title=\"Luis\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(40)</sup></button>. El è diligent. El scriva sin in <b>fegl da palpiri</b> alv. Avant el ha el mess ses <b>palpiri sugant</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.432091,0.739928,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"41\" title=\"palpiri sugant\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(41)</sup></button>.","t01-12-1":"12. — Ils scolars dal segund banc, a sanestra dal magister, èn fitg giuvens. L’emprim, il pitschen <b>Emil</b>, na sa anc betg scriver bain; el porta cun el ses <b>tavlin d’ardesia</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.45162,0.655421,0.011318,0.010481\" data-n=\"42\" title=\"tavlin d'ardesia\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(42)</sup></button>, ses <b>stilus</b> e sia <b>spugna</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.437195,0.627252,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"43\" title=\"spugna\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(43)</sup></button>.","t01-12-2":"Sper el èn <b>August</b> e <b>Bernard</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.437195,0.591549,0.011984,0.009499\" data-n=\"44\" title=\"Bernard\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(44)</sup></button>. Quest ultim lavura bain, ma sia <b>vestgadira</b> è fitg negligida.","t01-13-1":"13. — Suenter els sa chattan trais <b>pigers. Albert</b> n’emprenda betg sias lecziuns. <b>Jachen</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.629161,0.611857,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"47\" title=\"Jachen\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(47)</sup></button> dorma empè d’ascultar. Sia <b>pigrezza</b> al procura <b>reproschas</b> e schizunt <b>chastis</b>. Finalmain è <b>Cristian</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.679982,0.61153,0.009987,0.010154\" data-n=\"48\" title=\"Cristian\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(48)</sup></button> memia sfrenà. El <b>sa cumporta</b> mal e na fa nagin sforz per sa meglierar.","t01-14-1":"14. — Ses vischins, percunter, sa cumportan bain. <b>Ernest</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.699956,0.702588,0.007989,0.010809\" data-n=\"51\" title=\"Ernest\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(51)</sup></button> ha gugent l’<b>urden</b> e la <b>regularitad</b>; el duvra adina sia <b>regla</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.692632,0.793318,0.008877,0.010809\" data-n=\"50\" title=\"regla\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(50)</sup></button> e ses <b>crajun</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.671993,0.744841,0.010209,0.009171\" data-n=\"49\" title=\"crajun\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(49)</sup></button>. El è <b>extern</b>.","t01-14-2":"<b>Franzestg</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.780293,0.754012,0.009543,0.011137\" data-n=\"52\" title=\"Franzestg\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(52)</sup></button> è <b>intern</b>; el porta l’<b>uniforma</b> da l’institut; el maglia e dorma là. El è in bun <b>cumpogn</b>.","t01-14-3":"Maurizi taglia ses <b>crajun</b> cun ses <b>curtelin</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.786951,0.886341,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"56\" title=\"curtelin\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(56)</sup></button>; el è fitg premurus.","t01-14-4":"El porta cun el tut ses cudeschs, sia <b>grammatica</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.732801,0.892892,0.009543,0.010481\" data-n=\"55\" title=\"grammatica\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(55)</sup></button>, ses <b>cudeschet da notas</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.709055,0.857845,0.011096,0.010481\" data-n=\"54\" title=\"cudeschet da notas\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(54)</sup></button> e schizunt in <b>sutmaun</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.762761,0.880118,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"53\" title=\"sutmaun\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(53)</sup></button>. Ses <b>satg da scola</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.930537,0.91451,0.010209,0.010809\" data-n=\"57\" title=\"satg da scola\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(57)</sup></button> è per terra suenter el.","t01-14-5":"Las duas maisas en il fund da la sala da scola èn occupadas da <b>buns scolars</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.337772,0.507042,0.008433,0.010809\" data-n=\"19\" title=\"buns scolars\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(19)</sup></button>.","t01-tit-6":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Dissegn e musica.</span>","t01-15-1":"15. — En la <b>sala da dissegn</b> i ha bels <b>models</b> pendids vi da la paraid ed ina <b>lampa</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.975144,0.45922,0.009765,0.010809\" data-n=\"62\" title=\"lampa\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(62)</sup></button> cun <b>para-glisch</b>, suspendida al plafond. Il <b>magister</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.81447,0.575827,0.009543,0.011464\" data-n=\"60\" title=\"magister\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(60)</sup></button> è fitg pazient; el curregia ils <b>dissegns</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.891034,0.610219,0.007324,0.009826\" data-n=\"61\" title=\"dissegns\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(61)</sup></button> dals scolars ed als instruescha da dissegnar in <b>bust</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.976476,0.514248,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"59\" title=\"bust\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(59)</sup></button> tenor la natira.","t01-16-1":"16. — La <b>sala da musica</b> para fitg interessanta. Qua emprenda ins da leger la <b>musica</b>, da solfegiar las <b>notas da la gamma</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.753884,0.423845,0.011096,0.010481\" data-n=\"67\" title=\"notas da la gamma\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(67)</sup></button> scrittas sin il <b>sistem da lingias</b> (do, re, mi, fa, sol, la, si = C. D. E. F. G. A. B.), da renconuscher las <b>clavs</b> e da chantar bellas <b>melodias</b>. Ins metta las partituras sin il <b>pult</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.640257,0.466099,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"65\" title=\"pult\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(65)</sup></button>. In dals scolars <b>suna il piano</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.758766,0.510645,0.010652,0.010809\" data-n=\"64\" title=\"suna il piano\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(64)</sup></button> ed il <b>magister da musica</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.699512,0.461513,0.009099,0.010809\" data-n=\"66\" title=\"magister da musica\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(66)</sup></button> <b>bat la mesira</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.725477,0.447101,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"68\" title=\"bat la mesira\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(68)</sup></button>.","t01-17-1":"17. — Nus cumenzain a vesair in chantun da l’<b>ovratori</b> da <b>lavurs manualas</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.559698,0.471995,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"69\" title=\"lavurs manualas\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(69)</sup></button>, nua ch’ils mats pon emprender da plajar il lain e da limar il fier. Quai n’exista betg en tut ils instituts.","t01-tit-7":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">La sala da scienzas.</span>","t01-18-1":"18. — Il magister da matematica instruescha als scolars la <b>geometria, l’aritmetica, il calcul</b> e il <b>sistem metric</b>. Nus vesain sin la tabella las figuras geometricas principalas: in <b>circul</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.019633,0.658661,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"circul\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, in <b>quadrat</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.052468,0.626557,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"quadrat\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button>, in <b>triangul</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.049811,0.67077,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"triangul\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button>, ina <b>lingia</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.035173,0.739874,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"lingia\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>.","t01-18-2":"Nus vesain era ina <b>operaziun</b>; quai n’è betg ina <b>adiziun</b>, ni ina <b>sutracziun</b>, ni ina <b>multiplicaziun</b>: quai è ina <b>divisiun</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.065565,0.676005,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"divisiun\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>.","t01-19-1":"19. — Sin la tavla dal sistem metric distinguin nus: in <b>meter</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.052217,0.380286,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"meter\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, ina <b>balanza</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.015161,0.379639,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"balanza\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button> e sias <b>peisas</b>, in <b>liter</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.059978,0.343932,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"liter\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>, in <b>decaliter</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.013372,0.258796,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"f\" title=\"decaliter\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(f)</sup></button>, in <b>deciliter</b> ed in <b>meter cubic</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.03224,0.324944,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"meter cubic\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>.","t01-19-2":"Ils scolars studegian era las <b>scienzas natiralas</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.097426,0.279725,0.007767,0.010481\" data-n=\"11\" title=\"tavlas da mir\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(11)</sup></button> — zoologia <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.124098,0.290533,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"zoologia\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, botanica <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.132317,0.3652,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"botanica\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button>, geologia <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.127443,0.431354,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"geologia\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button> — e l’<b>istorgia</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.170883,0.311824,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"12\" title=\"tavlas da mir\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(12)</sup></button>.","t01-19-3":"En l’armari sa chattan ils apparats da <b>fisica</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.188859,0.618736,0.008877,0.010481\" data-n=\"15\" title=\"fisica\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(15)</sup></button> e da <b>chemia</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.230138,0.5755,0.009321,0.010481\" data-n=\"16\" title=\"chemia\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(16)</sup></button>.","t01-19-4":"Sur l’armari sa chattan: ina <b>sfera</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.189525,0.419915,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"14\" title=\"sfera\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(14)</sup></button>, in <b>cono</b> ed in <b>globus terrestric</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.175322,0.387815,0.010209,0.011464\" data-n=\"13\" title=\"globus terrestric\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(13)</sup></button>.","t01-19-5":"Sur las tavlas penda ina <b>charta</b> che represchenta las tschintg parts dal mund: l’<b>Europa</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.161802,0.143808,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"Europa\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>, l’<b>Asia</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.20951,0.166394,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"g\" title=\"Asia\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(g)</sup></button>, l’<b>Africa</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.155821,0.230267,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"f\" title=\"Africa\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(f)</sup></button>, l’<b>America</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.073486,0.101258,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"America\" aria-expanded=\"false\">a</button><button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.084585,0.148741,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"America\" aria-expanded=\"false\">b</button>)</sup> e l’<b>Oceania</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.209077,0.256781,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"h\" title=\"Oceania\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(h)</sup></button>, ed ils dus gronds oceans, il <b>Pacific</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.036213,0.146461,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"Pacific\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button> e l’<b>Atlantic</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.116538,0.161832,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"Atlantic\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>. <span class=\"fil\"></span>"},"noto":{"t01-noto-1":"(*) Per ils <i>nums da batten</i> vegn cusseglià da als transcriver era en la furma latina. Quai è l’unic med per evitar variantas senza dumber. Uschiglio, co eleger tranter <i>Giovanni, Jean,</i> <i>Johann, Jan, Hans, John, Ivan,</i> etc.? Stuain nus crear in dicziunari spezial per ils nums da batten? Nus prendain dal latin lur nominativ e din: <b>Ioannes, Ioanna; Iulius, Iulia; Iakobus; Andreas; Lukas.</b> (Grammatica cumpletta)."}}
